LCAO (gamma-only) neutral water with periodic SCCS (water-neutral preset), same geometry as
01_PW/scf_sccs. Covers the LCAO path end to end: SCCS potential in the LCAO
Hamiltonian, local Pulay force terms and final force assembly of the SCCS ionic force.
Checks total energy, forces and the electrostatic and cavity solvation terms.
ecutwfc is 60 because LCAO requires ecutrho = 4 * ecutwfc; ecutrho 240 keeps the density grid of
the PW case. result.ref was generated on one MPI process and also passes on four.
